  "description": "The Authio client for .NET without any ASP.NET Core dependency: discovery, every token grant Authio supports (client credentials, authorization code, refresh, token exchange, connected accounts, device), client authentication with a secret or a private_key_jwt assertion, introspection, revocation, userinfo, a cached client-credentials HttpClient handler, the Authio roles model, webhook signature verification and an Admin API client that authenticates with any account credential (API key, personal access token or client secret).",
